# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ── Local databases, backups, dumps ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
/backups/
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# ── Local diagnostics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ROOT-ANCHORED on purpose. v4 carried an unanchored `*probe*.py`, which also
# swallowed legitimate committed files anywhere in the tree — including
# `tests/test_consumption_retention_probe.py`. Leading slash = repo root only,
# which is where throwaway probes actually get written.
/*probe*.py
/scratch/
/tmp/

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.vscode/
*.swp
